<title>GERMANY: Weekend German poll offers little risk to markets.</title>
<headline>Weekend German poll offers little risk to markets.</headline>
<byline>Scott Miller</byline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Local elections in the German state of Hesse this weekend are unlikely to upset financial markets despite the poll's apparent importance as a referendum</p>
